/E (First pass: Block in the pupil as pure PC935 Black, leaving a small specular highlight white \(unpainted circle\). Establish the cast shadow from the upper lid \(a dark crescent above the iris\) using PC1081 Chestnut slightly darkened with PC932 Violet. This creates the recess and makes the eye read as sitting back in the skull.)
